   ["원문: Volunteering is valuable. Moreover, it helps others. Moreover, it teaches responsibility. Moreover, it builds friendships. Moreover, it looks good on applications. (Moreover × 4 → 기계적)", "고침: Volunteering is valuable for teenagers. First, it allows them to help people in need. It also teaches responsibility, because volunteers must keep their promises. In addition, students often build new friendships while working together. Furthermore, the experience can help them discover future careers. / 원칙: 필요한 곳만, 다양하게, also 문장 안, 순서어 활용"],
